16288 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 16287 0 R
  /Alt (Three panels of the same points: a small round cloud near the origin, a long horizontal band just above it that reaches the cloud at its left end, and scattered points. In the k-means panel, a straight boundary cuts the band, and its left part joins the round cloud. In the mixture model panel, the round cloud and the band are separated. In the DBSCAN panel, the cloud and the band form a single cluster, and most scattered points are marked as noise.)
